Usage of spectra process:
  -classify
    	Add role, runtime, owning app and (macOS) code signing per process
  -deep
    	Enrich with open FD count and listening ports via lsof (slower)
  -fd-breakdown
    	Show typed FD columns (implies --deep)
  -group-by string
    	Group processes: family (sums CPU per simulator device, Xcode, build tools, browsers)
  -json
    	Emit JSON instead of a human summary
  -min-elapsed duration
    	Minimum elapsed runtime
  -min-rss string
    	Minimum RSS (for example 500M, 2G)
  -min-vsz string
    	Minimum VSZ (for example 1G)
  -ppid int
    	Only direct children of PID (default -1)
  -sort string
    	Sort by: rss, vsz, cpu, mem, elapsed, startedat, pid, or cmd (default "rss")
  -top int
    	Show only top N processes (0 = all)
  -tree
    	Render a parent/child process tree
  -user string
    	Only processes owned by user name
